        "title": "fix(diagnostics-prometheus): use truncateUtf16Safe for error message truncation",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nOne `.slice(0, 500)` truncation site in the Prometheus diagnostics extension may cut UTF-16 surrogate pairs in half when the error message contains multi-byte characters such as emoji.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `extensions/diagnostics-prometheus/src/service.ts`: replace safeErrorMessage's `.slice(0, 500)` with `truncateUtf16Safe`.\n\nLabel: bugfix | merge-risk: 🟢 minimal",
